title=Cleanin' Out My Closet
artist=Eminem
album=The Eminem Show
quality=high
lyrkind=line

[00:11.96]Where's my snare?
[00:15.62]I have no snare on my headphones
[00:21.07]There you go
[00:24.02]Yeah
[00:28.16]Yo
[00:29.40]Yo
[00:32.97]Have you ever been hated or discriminated against?
[00:36.23]I have
[00:37.16]I've been protested and demonstrated against
[00:39.76]Picket signs for my wicked rhymes
[00:42.11]Look at the times
[00:43.19]Sick as the mind of the motherfucking kid that's behind
[00:45.83]All this commotion, emotions run deep as oceans explodin'
[00:49.32]Tempers flarin' from parents, just blow 'em off and keep goin'
[00:52.67]Not takin' nothin' from no one, give 'em hell long as I'm breathin'
[00:56.02]Keep kickin' ass in the mornin' and takin' names in the evenin'
[00:59.03]Leavin' with a taste as sour as vinegar in their mouth
[01:02.34]See they can trigger me
[01:03.83]But they never figure me out
[01:05.69]Look at me now
[01:06.79]I betcha probably sick of me now
[01:08.80]Ain't you, mama?
[01:09.86]Imma make you look so ridiculous now
[01:11.96]I'm sorry mama
[01:14.63]I never meant to hurt you
[01:17.84]I never meant to make you cry
[01:20.25]But tonight
[01:21.22]I'm cleanin' out my closet
[01:23.37]One more time
[01:25.08]I said I'm sorry mama
[01:27.40]I never meant to hurt you
[01:30.54]I never meant to make you cry
[01:33.00]But tonight
[01:34.17]I'm cleanin' out my closet
[01:36.36]Ah
[01:38.17]I got some skeletons in my closet and I don't know if no one knows it
[01:41.77]So before they throw me inside my coffin and close it
[01:44.63]Imma expose it
[01:46.00]I'll take you back to '73
[01:47.63]Before I ever had a multi-platinum sellin' CD
[01:50.80]I was a baby
[01:52.12]Maybe I was just a couple of months
[01:54.13]My faggot father must've had his panties up in a bunch
[01:57.34]'Cause he split
[01:58.44]I wonder if he even kissed me goodbye
[02:00.51]No, I don't owe him a second thought
[02:02.76]I just fuckin' wished he would die
[02:04.08]I look at Hailie
[02:05.16]And I couldn't picture leavin' her side
[02:07.09]Even if I hated Kim
[02:08.68]I'd grit my teeth and I'd try
[02:10.35]To make it work with her, at least for Hailie's sake
[02:12.49]I maybe made some mistakes but I'm only human
[02:15.24]But I'm man enough to face 'em today
[02:17.42]What I did was stupid
[02:19.02]No doubt it was dumb
[02:20.19]But the smartest shit I did was take the bullets outta that gun
[02:23.17]'Cause I'd have killed 'em
[02:24.94]Shit, I woulda shot Kim and them both
[02:26.66]It's my life
[02:27.55]I'd like to welcome ya'll to the Eminem Show
[02:29.84]I'm sorry mama
[02:32.40]I never meant to hurt you
[02:35.66]I never meant to make you cry
[02:37.91]But tonight
[02:38.98]I'm cleanin' out my closet
[02:41.13]One more time
[02:42.68]I said I'm sorry mama
[02:45.31]I never meant to hurt you
[02:48.54]I never meant to make you cry
[02:50.92]But tonight
[02:51.91]I'm cleanin' out my closet
[02:55.26]Now I would never diss my own mama just to get recognition
[02:58.86]Take a second to listen 'fore you think this record is dissin'
[03:02.25]But put yourself in my position
[03:04.01]Just try to envision
[03:05.57]Witnessin' your mama poppin' prescription pills in the kitchen
[03:08.62]Bitchin' that someone's always goin' through hear purse
[03:11.29]And shit's missin'
[03:12.33]Goin' through public housin' systems, victim of Munchhausen's Syndrome
[03:15.12]My whole life I was made to believe I was sick when I wasn't
[03:18.47]'Til I grew up, now I blew up
[03:20.29]It makes you sick to your stomach, doesn't it?
[03:22.00]Wasn't it the reason you made that CD for me, ma?
[03:24.71]So you could try to justify the way you treated me, ma?
[03:28.12]But guess what?
[03:29.22]You're gettin' older now and it's cold when you're lonely
[03:31.60]And Nathan's growin' up so quick
[03:33.29]He's gonna know that you're phony
[03:34.86]And Hailie's getting' so big now
[03:36.56]You should see her, she's beautiful
[03:38.04]But you'll never see her
[03:39.41]She won't even be at your funeral
[03:41.27]See, what hurts me the most is you won't admit you was wrong
[03:44.51]Bitch, do your song
[03:45.62]Keep tellin' yourself that you was a mom
[03:47.64]But how dare you try to take what you didn't help me to get?
[03:50.34]You selfish bitch
[03:52.01]I hope you fuckin' burn in hell for this shit
[03:54.05]Remember when Ronnie died and you said you wished it was me?
[03:57.48]Well, guess what?
[03:59.03]I am dead, dead to you as can be!
[04:00.96]I'm sorry mama
[04:03.35]I never meant to hurt you
[04:06.09]I never meant to make you cry
[04:08.82]But tonight
[04:09.86]I'm cleanin' out my closet
[04:12.27]One more time
[04:13.35]I said I'm sorry mama
[04:16.26]I never meant to hurt you
[04:19.30]I never meant to make you cry
[04:21.97]But tonight
[04:22.83]I'm cleanin' out my closet
